  "answer_to_user": "The 'Uranium & Nuclear Fuel Cycle' theme (spanning mining + conversion/enrichment) gives the real cross-market roster:\n\nMiners: Cameco (CCJ.US) — the western major · NexGen Energy (NXE.US) · Uranium Energy (UEC.US) · Energy Fuels (UUUU.US) · Denison Mines (DNN.US) · Ur-Energy (URG.US) · enCore Energy (EU.US) · Uranium Royalty (UROY.US) · plus Chinese names China National Uranium (001280.CS) and CGN Mining (1164.HK).\n\nEnrichment / fuel cycle: Centrus Energy (LEU.US) — US enrichment · BWX Technologies (BWXT.US) — nuclear fuel/components · Lightbridge (LTBR.US) — fuel technology · ASP Isotopes (ASPI.US, secondary).\n\nSo Cameco, Kazatomprom-style miners (NexGen, Denison, UEC) and the enrichers (Centrus, BWXT) are all here — a genuine miners-plus-enrichment list across US, Canada, China and UK-listed juniors, not just power utilities. (Kazatomprom itself doesn't appear in this 30-name slice.)"
}